- op: discuss  # ff92
  at: '2026-03-16T04:04:40Z'  # ff92
  by: agent  # ff92
  actor: jgstern_agent  # ff92
  clock: 9  # ff92
  nonce: ff92  # ff92
  message: "The JSX Route detection (PR #2127) covers the basic <Route path='...' /> pattern. Aspects NOT verified: (1) nested routes (<Route><Route path='child'/></Route>), (2) createBrowserRouter/createRoutesFromElements API (v6.4+), (3) lazy routes (React.lazy + dynamic import), (4) route loader/action detection. I haven't checked these against real React Router apps since the PR merged. Status 'holding' means the basic pattern works; it does not mean all React Router idioms are covered."  # ff92
